2F25913951%2F1726820857519-9a45ea7d-035f-4b10-bc74-9d12bf4699a2.jpeg%22%2C%22graphicsBBox%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A-371%2C%22y%22%3A-515.3499755859375%2C%22width%22%3A635%2C%22height%22%3A517.5687255859375%7D%2C%22id%22%3A%22kj9En%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc815b217\" id=\"uc815b217\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4bb3be4c\" id=\"u4bb3be4c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">JDK1.8版本的具体实现方式</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u05a606cb\" id=\"u05a606cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60cf3bb2\" id=\"u60cf3bb2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">在JDK1.8版本中，ConcurrentHashMap的底层数据结构为数组+链表+红黑树。它通过‌CAS（Compare and Swap）操作和synchronized关键字来实现线程安全。CAS操作保证了原子性，而synchronized用于锁住链表或红黑树的头节点，从而在插入、删除和更新操作时保证线程安全。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub6e97892\" id=\"ub6e97892\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F25913951%2F1726837033835-3b4ac637-c685-4262-a32f-4f14bad197ed.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6f9fea03-f89b-4ca5-9eeb-abe782d6891%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u9555a4cb-50f7-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A762%2C%22height%22%3A414%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%221726837029323.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A133816%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A762%2C%22originHeight%22%3A414%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22HASHMAPBASEONJDK18%22%2C%22x%22%3A287%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BA%A2%E9%BB%91%E6%A0%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A433%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BA%A2%E9%BB%91%E6%A0%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A223%2C%22y%22%3A267%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%93%BE%E8%A1%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A280%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%93%BE%E8%A1%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A380%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6ece8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pp58e%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u66321baa\" id=\"u66321baa\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1e508ee1\" id=\"u1e508ee1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c894c69\" id=\"u6c894c69\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">优势和特点</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0122bff2\" id=\"u0122bff2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u380b21e0\" id=\"u380b21e0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">ConcurrentHashMap的优势在于其高并发性能、可伸缩性和可靠性。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u60bf798a\" id=\"u60bf798a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11a01edc\" id=\"u11a01edc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">它通过读写分离策略、无锁读取以及通过调整Segment数量来控制并发度，适应了高并发场景的需求。此外，ConcurrentHashMap还实现了预测性的‌重新哈希算法，提高了扩容时的性能。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3058ff92\" id=\"u3058ff92\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79b2874c\" id=\"u79b2874c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">从1.7到1.8版本，由于HashEntry从链表 变成了红黑树所以 concurrentHashMap的时间复杂度从O(n)到O(log(n))</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u36e35fff\" id=\"u36e35fff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f8ba0db\" id=\"u0f8ba0db\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">HashEntry最小的容量为2</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udf93c62b\" id=\"udf93c62b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec308539\" id=\"uec308539\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">Segment的初始化容量是16;</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u97c0cef8\" id=\"u97c0cef8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c328a1b\" id=\"u7c328a1b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">HashEntry在1.8中称为Node,链表转红黑树的值是8 ,当Node链表的节点数大于8时Node会自动转化为TreeNode,会转换成红黑树的结构。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u75d30724\" id=\"u75d30724\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud1f987fd\" id=\"ud1f987fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9724cc8\" id=\"uf9724cc8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">什么是CAS？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ueae248f7\" id=\"ueae248f7\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F25913951%2F1726819218346-76201e46-d545-4d01-9204-eee43f6b9c05.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u861edca8-ff9b-4fd5-89e5-4831d7c8074%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u08c20dd3-95e9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A680%2C%22height%22%3A597%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%221726819212258.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A309496%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A680%2C%22originHeight%22%3A597%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAS%E5%8E%9F%E5%AD%90%E6%80%A7%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%22%2C%22x%22%3A104%2C%22y%22%3A472%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9C%9F%E6%9C%9B%E5%80%BCE%E4%B8%890%22%2C%22x%22%3A159%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%80%BCV%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%88%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A270%2C%22y%22%3A417%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%80%BCV%22%2C%22x%22%3A472%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%80%BCV-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A473%2C%22y%22%3A425%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E7%BA%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A621%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%B0%E5%80%BCN%22%2C%22x%22%3A290%2C%22y%22%3A435%2C%22width%22%3A57%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%B0%E5%80%BCN%3D1%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A393%2C%22y%22%3A428%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%22%2C%22x%22%3A305%2C%22y%22%3A534%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A140%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96V%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22x%22%3A406%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A304%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A429%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A8%2C%22height%22%3A44%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22V-EE%22%2C%22x%22%3A303%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BA%BF%E7%A8%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A301%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23dfe1ca%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EFJWY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8da6ef45\" id=\"u8da6ef45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9bcf13b4\" id=\"u9bcf13b4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">CAS（Compare-And-Swap）乐观锁是一种在多线程环境下实现同步功能的机制，它通过比较并替换操作来实现数据的同步。具体来说，CAS操作包含三个操作数：需要更新的内存值V、进行比较的预期值A和要写入的新值B。CAS的逻辑是将需要更新的内存值V和预期值A进行比较，当且仅当V的值等于A时，CAS会通过原子方式用新值B来更新V的值（“比较+更新”整体是一个原子操作），否则不会执行任何操作。一般情况下，“更新”是一个不断重试的操作，直到满足条件为止。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7337fd88\" id=\"u7337fd88\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub54b043d\" id=\"ub54b043d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-18\">CAS乐观锁的核心思想在于，它乐观地认为程序中的并发情况不那么严重，因此让线程不断尝试更新，而不是立即锁定资源。这种机制在不使用传统互斥锁的情况下，通过不断重试的方式保证了多线程对共享变量的安全访问，从而提高了系统的并发性能和吞吐量，同时保证了数据的一致性和线程安全性。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u486a69db\" id=\"u486a69db\"><span data-lake-id=\"u146c6ebf\" id=\"u146c6ebf\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7af5d04c\" id=\"u7af5d04c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u522996ff\" id=\"u522996ff\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u21bb965f\" id=\"u21bb965f\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0e3728d6\" id=\"u0e3728d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u09fbb491\" id=\"u09fbb491\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u578d549f\" id=\"u578d549f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3615914\" id=\"uf3615914\">  </span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 783, "description": "ConcurrentHashMap是线程安全的，主要得益于其独特的‌分段锁和内部数据结构设计。‌‌HashTable的实现方式JDK1.7版本的具体实现方式在JDK1.7版本中，ConcurrentHashMap采用了分段锁机制，每个Segment内部的操作都是线程安全的。每个Segment继...", "updated_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:20.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:39:01.000Z", "id": 216261325, "status": 1}